undead slayer is probably one of the smallest idomatic stretches and has
a semi-cultural precedent in the Buffyverse anyway.

Barbs seem too far out of idiom for elves and drow. An uncouth
elf is probably more of a woodelfy ranger type.

> Could someone who knows about Gnomes please explain why they are not
> allowed to be Monks or Priests?  

I can see a gnomish tourist--a camera, a flamboyant shirt, and a lot
of gold are just the sort of things a gnome might take on holiday.
Gnomes are esoteric and quirky, which seem like a tourist thing.

II'll try an explanation of why no gnomish monks or priests: gnomes
are practical and selfish, and would have little stomach (npi) for fasting
and suffering in the pursuit of some abstract ideal that didn't have assured
remuneration (which is why the Healer business is palatable). Gnomes
cackle at the suggestion that they abandon the use of their beloved
tools and devices to seek personal perfection and higher oneness with
the divine.

